{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Nobleindie","id":"361351593292988425","is_bot":0,"username":"nobleindie"},"author_id":"361351593292988425","channel_id":"733827922749685830","content":"Lilia begins the ritual at the center point of the area , right next to the hanging tree. She lays out the Raven Queen banner Wynne gave her.. On it, she places her holy symbol, the raven's skull given to her by Web, holy water, and various momentos she has gathered, this includes the momentos given to her by the others. There is a lit incense on each corner of the cloth. She kneels and begins the ritual for Hallow. Her words are in Celestial, || “Raven Queen, I bless this land, in your name. This land, this island, is cursed and I wish to see it healed. Death will not be able to reach you properly if this world is sick. Here I will create a space free from the illnesses of this world and of others. Here a space where death can come naturally, here where the unnatural will not enter.”|| As she prays there is a thin outline of her black wings manifesting behind her. The air around her turns peaceful and cool, and her eyes grow dark.  She continues to pray in Celestial sitting in front of the mini altar she has made.","created_at":"2020-08-16T04:51:32.747000Z","edited_at":"2020-08-16T04:54:49.830000Z","id":"744418045841113099","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
