{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"DCJJ","id":"629235245291667476","is_bot":0,"username":"dcjj"},"author_id":"629235245291667476","channel_id":"733827922749685830","content":"Copper gives an offering of his Dagger of Venom. A gift given to him by his friend Traxim, before he disappeared suddenly.\nThis dagger was acquired after a fight for our lives. It has since been used many times since then to assist Copper in defending everyone in town. Copper sees this dagger as an extension of himself. Not just a weapon, but also a tool. An item that without, he believes he would have lost his life many times over. Without this gift he received, he fully believes he would have failed everyone. This gift was given to him in good faith, so he in turn lays it here in kind.","created_at":"2020-08-16T05:00:46.072000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"744420366654505040","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
